  "_comment": "Per-(problem, difficulty) experiment sizing for the ITCAS sweep. budget/batch_size/n_init scale with the problem (dimension, #objectives) and the difficulty (joint-feasible fraction), so they live here instead of in scripts/jobs.json (which only selects the sweep matrix: method x problem x difficulty x seeds). Resolution order for each field: problems[<problem>][<difficulty>] -> problems[<problem>].defaults -> top-level defaults. The <difficulty> key is the threshold_pct string (e.g. \"0.05\"); for uncalibrated/default-threshold runs the key is \"defaults\". eps_archive is the \u03b5-Archive Size distance threshold in normalised objective space (0.05 = 5% of the normalised range). Owned jointly: the Slurm Operator wires it into the launcher; the Scientific Coder tunes the numbers.",
